\title{Tumor2Line: population-aware tumor-cell line alignment}
\description{
Tumor2Line is a population-aware transcriptomic framework for aligning
tumor-derived query populations with candidate cancer cell-line populations
to support cancer cell-line selection. It ranks shared genes by log-expression
variability, supports cohort-specific PCA and projection into a frozen external
reference PCA space, and performs lineage-aware unbalanced optimal transport
matching.
